You know the perception that people have of them?

00:33:50.160 --> 00:33:50.240
Yeah.

00:33:50.240 --> 00:33:50.640
When they hear of Congo,

00:33:50.640 --> 00:33:50.880
they think war,

00:33:50.880 --> 00:33:51.240
they think the jungle,

00:33:51.240 --> 00:33:58.840
civilized people.

00:33:58.840 --> 00:34:00.640
This type of supermarket in the city

00:34:01.280 --> 00:34:03.760
is attracting more and more well-off clients,

00:34:04.320 --> 00:34:06.400
as well as those who have lived abroad,

00:34:06.480 --> 00:34:08.040
